7. WHAT THE SIX QUERIES DEMONSTRATE

Query What it shows
1 Happy path — HALT policy, no safety-critical action
2 Multi-step plan — ROLLBACK policy, no refusal
3 Safety-critical plan — ESCALATE policy, no refusal
4 Per-action envelope passes; trajectory predicate fails; refusal escalates
5 Second predicate exercised; refusal escalates
6 Third predicate exercised; refusal escalates

Three predicates, three refusals, three safe states. The trajectory layer is exercised completely.

Query 4 is the case that justifies the extension. Query 5 and Query 6 demonstrate that the mechanism is general — not a single predicate catching a single edge case.

