11. THE LINE THAT MATTERS

No per-action contract can see this hazard. It lives in the trace. This is the case that justifies the trajectory layer.

Query 4 is that case.

Query 5 and Query 6 show it is not an isolated catch.

The ESCALATE policy is what makes the refusal safe.

